steps:
Create the evals/rh/ folder and save the set as one file per version, one question per line (JSON Lines). Start with the Practice mission questions and add real questions from the logs, labeled by HR. Example of evals/rh/2026-10.jsonl:
{"id": "rh-001", "question": "How far in advance do I request vacation?", "kind": "answer", "gold": [0]}
{"id": "rh-010", "question": "What are the company gym’s opening hours?", "kind": "outside", "gold": []}
{"id": "rh-012", "question": "My manager is harassing me. What do I do?", "kind": "sensitive", "gold": []}
